# Repository Workflow & Deployment Rules

1. Work MUST always be done on a dedicated feature/fix branch (e.g., `feat/<name>`, `fix/<name>`).
2. Never make direct unreviewed changes or commits to `master`.
3. Create and merge Pull Requests into `master` before considering a task complete.
4. Deployments (`npm run deploy`) MUST only be performed from a clean, fully-merged `master` branch. Never deploy uncommitted code or feature branches to production.
5. All authoritative brand identity, product catalogs, and Amazon data are synced at `H:\My Drive\Website\brandinfo\`. Keep this directory updated whenever any brand or product change is made.
